-- הסכם קיבוצי (מסגרת) מיום 17.4.2008 — מסגרת עלות הסכמי השכר לעובדים
-- בשירות המעסיקים: the public-sector framework agreement of the 2008 wage
-- round, between the State, the public employers and the New General
-- Histadrut, for the scales the Histadrut represents. Its period and whom
-- it covers (§§1–3); the cost frame for 1.7.2005–31.12.2008, 1.5% from
-- 1.1.2008, 3% from 1.12.2008 and 5% from 1.12.2009, and the local
-- authorities' share of it (§4); the salary base it is measured on and how
-- (§§5–7); the one-time grant that allocates the 1.5% of 2008 (§8); the
-- negotiation that allocates the rest, the data the Histadrut may ask for,
-- and when what it agrees is paid (§§9–10); the budgetary pensioners — the
-- bill that links their determining salary to the index, supplements A, B
-- and C, and the employers' own arrangements (§11) — and their welfare
-- fund (§12); the structure of employment (§13); the retirement grade in
-- the civil service (§14); disputes, exhaustion of claims, industrial
-- peace, earlier agreements, the follow-up committee and the agreed
-- arbitration institution (§§15–20). Annexed: paragraph 85.125 of the
-- Takshir, which §14.2 gives the standing of a collective agreement.
--
-- It covers no teaching employee: the teachers' scales are represented by
-- Histadrut HaMorim and the secondary teachers' organisation, not by the
-- Histadrut (§3; the Collective Agreements Law, §§15–16, imported). The
-- teachers' agreements of the round take its rates and dates through their
-- own clauses, and import it: the Ofek Hadash founding agreement of
-- 10.9.2007, §76(ג), the Oz LaTmura agreement of 24.1.2008, §4(י), and
-- Histadrut HaMorim's wage agreement of 21.2.2008, §4(יא)–(יב).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT collective_agreements_law

§ `הסכם קיבוצי (מסגרת) — מסגרת עלות הסכמי השכר לעובדים בשירות המעסיקים (17.4.2008)`

DECLARE `2008 framework action` IS ONE OF
    `sign the local authorities' agreement on distortions`
    `bring the distortions agreement to the wages commissioner's approval`
    `pay the 2008 one-time grant`
    `pay a former employee his share of the 2008 grant`
    `pay a later-joining employee the 2008 grant`
    `make the provident-fund contributions on the 2008 grant`
    `discuss with the Histadrut a supplement it would put into the 2008 base`
    `negotiate an agreement carrying out sections 4 to 7 of the 2008 framework`
    `pass the Histadrut the salary data it asks for under the 2008 framework`
    `examine a 2008 framework request to process salary data favourably`
    `tell the Histadrut the cost of processing the 2008 salary data`
    `say whether the Histadrut bears the cost of the 2008 processing`
    `produce the processed 2008 salary data against payment`
    `decide the scales left without a 2008 agreement`
    `pay the differences from 1.12.2008`
    `pay what a 2008 section 9 agreement gives`
    `bring the bill linking the determining salary to the index to the government`
    `support the 2008 pension bill as one package`
    `demand a further pension rise for erosion to 31.12.2008`
    `claim against the automatic change of the pension update`
    `apply the pension supplements the amending law sets`
    `update the determining salary in the January or February pension`
    `pay supplement A's differences`
    `pay supplement B from the January or February 2009 pension`
    `discuss the pensioners if the bill is not passed by 31.12.2008`
    `transfer the pensioners' welfare sum to the fund`
    `set up the pensioners' welfare fund`
    `report on the welfare fund each year`
    `send the wages commissioner a copy of the 2008 welfare fund's reports`
    `name the members of the supreme parity committee`
    `set up an employer's parity committee on the structure of employment`
    `bring the proposal to cancel section 3 of decision 781 to the government`
    `negotiate further on pay for the 2008 framework's period`
    `strike over a matter the 2008 framework settled`
    `decide disputes over the 2008 framework`
    `consult the deputy commissioner for discipline on a retirement promotion`

-- Time in salary months: `the 2008 framework month` y m is month m of year y.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 framework month` y m IS
    y TIMES 12 PLUS m

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 A page number; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The registry number (20080157); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 "Between"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p20 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p21 "And"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p22 The Histadrut and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p23 The Histadrut's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p24 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p25 A page number; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p26 A recital: the parties negotiated the cost frame of the wage agreements for the period to 31.12.2008, and on account of it.
-- akn:preamble/p27 A recital: they set the understandings down in this collective agreement.
-- akn:preamble/p28 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

-- ¶4: the day of signing, 17 April 2008 (the Hebrew year beside it is a
-- corpus sic, taken as given).
@ref akn:preamble/p4
`the 2008 framework agreement was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 17 4 2008

-- ¶6–¶18: the employers that sign, and (¶19) their short name, "המעסיקים":
-- the State; the local authorities through the Centre of Local Government
-- (save the three large cities); the three large cities; the regional
-- councils; the religious councils; the National Insurance Institute; the
-- Employment Service; the institutions of higher education; Hadassah;
-- Clalit; the Airports Authority; Israel Post; the fire-service
-- associations of towns.
@ref akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 akn:preamble/p12 akn:preamble/p13 akn:preamble/p14 akn:preamble/p15 akn:preamble/p16 akn:preamble/p17 akn:preamble/p18 akn:preamble/p19
`the employers that signed the 2008 framework` MEANS
    LIST "מדינת ישראל", "הרשויות המקומיות (מרכז השלטון המקומי)", "שלוש הערים הגדולות", "המועצות האזוריות",
         "המועצות הדתיות", "המוסד לביטוח לאומי", "שירות התעסוקה", "המוסדות להשכלה גבוהה", "הסתדרות מדיצינית הדסה",
         "שירותי בריאות כללית", "רשות שדות התעופה", "חברת דואר ישראל", "איגודי ערים לכבאות"

§§ `1–3 מבוא, תקופה ותחולה`

-- akn:art_1 The heading of §1.
-- akn:art_2 The heading of §2.
-- akn:art_3 The heading of §3.

-- §1 ¶1: the preamble is part of the agreement. ¶2: its headings are for
-- convenience only and do not bear on its reading — the agreement itself
-- answers here what convention precedence.heading answers where a text is
-- silent.
@ref akn:art_1/p1
`the 2008 framework agreement's preamble is part of it` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:art_1/p2
`the 2008 framework agreement's headings bear on its reading` MEANS FALSE

-- §2: the agreement is for the time to 31.12.2009, the day in (convention
-- dates.end). The recital's negotiation was over the cost frame for the
-- time to 31.12.2008 (§4.1 ¶3: 1.7.2005–31.12.2008); the frame is paid in
-- steps that run to 1.12.2009, inside the agreement's period.
@ref akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the 2008 framework agreement's period` d IF
    d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2009)

-- §3: it covers every employee of an employer that signed it whose pay is
-- computed by the collective agreements of a scale the Histadrut
-- represents, employed in the months a payment out of the cost frame (§4)
-- is made for ("העובדים"), as this agreement and the agreements still to be
-- signed set out. The section those agreements are signed under is §9; §3
-- names "סעיף 8" (finding F-framework-2008-a).
@desc An employee, as far as the framework agreement of 17.4.2008 asks.
DECLARE `2008 framework employee` HAS
    `employed by an employer that signed the 2008 framework` IS A BOOLEAN
    `his pay is computed by the agreements of a scale the Histadrut represents` IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed in the month the 2008 payment is made for` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:art_3/p1
GIVEN e IS A `2008 framework employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2008 framework agreement covers` e IF
        e's `employed by an employer that signed the 2008 framework`
    AND e's `his pay is computed by the agreements of a scale the Histadrut represents`
    AND e's `employed in the month the 2008 payment is made for`

-- The same, as the Collective Agreements Law asks it (§§15–16): the kinds
-- of employee the agreement includes are those of the Histadrut's scales.
-- Whether it is a special agreement or a general one, it does not reach an
-- employee of another kind, whoever employs him — so a teaching employee,
-- whose scale another organisation represents, is outside it, and §23
-- never weighs it against a teachers' agreement.
GIVEN e IS A `2008 framework employee`
GIVETH AN `employee a collective agreement may reach`
DECIDE `the 2008 framework employee, as the law asks` e IS
    `employee a collective agreement may reach` WITH
        `his employer is a party to the agreement`  IS e's `employed by an employer that signed the 2008 framework`
        `his employer is represented for it by an employers' organisation that is a party` IS e's `employed by an employer that signed the 2008 framework`
        `his employer was or became a member of an employers' organisation that is a party` IS e's `employed by an employer that signed the 2008 framework`
        `his employer was expressly left out of the agreement` IS FALSE
        `he is of a kind of employee the agreement includes` IS e's `his pay is computed by the agreements of a scale the Histadrut represents`
        `he is in an occupation or post the agreement includes` IS TRUE

§§ `4 מסגרת עלות התוספות`

-- akn:art_4 The heading of §4.

-- 4.1 (the heading, the State's service and the other employers save the
-- local authorities) ¶2–¶3: the cost frame of the wage supplements and the
-- money benefits ("מסגרת עלות התוספות") for 1.7.2005–31.12.2008, in the
-- State's service and among the other employers that signed save the local
-- authorities: 4.1.1 from 1.1.2008 to 30.11.2008, 1.5%; 4.1.2 from
-- 1.12.2008 to 30.11.2009, completed to 3%; 4.1.3 from 1.12.2009 on,
-- completed to 5% — each on the salary base of §5.1, and (¶2) by the
-- computation §6 sets. "השלמה ל-" makes each figure the whole frame from
-- its day. 4.1.1 ¶2: the 1.5% of 1.1–30.11.2008 is allocated by §8 (the
-- one-time grant), not by a rise in pay.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-1 akn:art_4__para_4-1/p2 akn:art_4__para_4-1/p3 akn:art_4__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1 akn:art_4__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p2 akn:art_4__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2 akn:art_4__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-3 akn:art_4__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-3/p2
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 framework cost frame on` d IS
    BRANCH
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2009) THEN 5%
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2008) THEN 3%
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2008) THEN 1.5%
        OTHERWISE 0

-- The same frame for a salary month counted as `the 2008 framework month`
-- (the steps start on the first of a month, so the month's salary is
-- the day's).
GIVEN m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 framework cost frame in the salary month` m IS
    BRANCH
        IF m AT LEAST `the 2008 framework month` 2009 12 THEN 5%
        IF m AT LEAST `the 2008 framework month` 2008 12 THEN 3%
        IF m AT LEAST `the 2008 framework month` 2008 1 THEN 1.5%
        OTHERWISE 0

-- What of the frame is paid as a rise in the monthly pay: none before
-- 1.12.2008, since 4.1.1's 1.5% goes to the grant of §8 and §4.3 pays
-- nothing else for work before that day.
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 framework frame allocated to monthly pay on` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2008)
    THEN `the 2008 framework cost frame on` d
    ELSE 0

-- akn:art_4__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p2 A page number; no rule.

-- 4.2 (the heading, the local authorities, the three large cities among
-- them) ¶2: the local authorities' frame is 4.1's, with its steps, less an
-- amount or rate allocated to correcting distortions by a collective
-- agreement for the local authorities' employees (the three large cities'
-- among them); ¶3: that agreement is signed by the Centre of Local
-- Government and the three large cities with the Histadrut and brought to
-- the wages commissioner's approval (no deadline: convention
-- dates.no-deadline); ¶4: it sets its cost and how it is taken from the
-- frames of 4.1.1–4.1.3 (4.1.1's for 1.1–30.11.2008 being allocated by §8).
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-2 akn:art_4__para_4-2/p2 akn:art_4__para_4-2/p4
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `what the distortions agreement takes on that day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 framework cost frame of the local authorities on` d `what the distortions agreement takes on that day` IS
    `the 2008 framework cost frame on` d MINUS `what the distortions agreement takes on that day`

`why the distortions agreement is not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "ההסכם הקיבוצי לתיקון עיוותים לעובדי הרשויות המקומיות (סעיף 4.2 להסכם המסגרת מיום 17.4.2008)"

@ref akn:art_4__para_4-2/p3
`signing the distortions agreement` MEANS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `sign the local authorities' agreement on distortions`
    HENCE (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
           MUST  `bring the distortions agreement to the wages commissioner's approval`)

-- ¶5: where this leaves the agreements signed under §9 contradicting §21,
-- or 21.1–21.2, of chapter ה' of the local authorities' work constitution,
-- or the like provisions in the three large cities, this section and
-- those agreements prevail.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-2/p5
`the 2008 framework and its section 9 agreements prevail over section 21 of the local authorities' work constitution` MEANS TRUE

`why the work constitution is not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוקת העבודה לעובדי הרשויות המקומיות, פרק ה', סעיף 21"

-- 4.3: nothing at all is paid for work before 1.12.08 beyond the one-time
-- grant this agreement pays.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-3
GIVEN `the work was done on` IS A DATE, `the payment is the one-time grant` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2008 framework may pay for work done on` `the work was done on` `the payment is the one-time grant` IF
       `the work was done on` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2008)
    OR `the payment is the one-time grant`

§§ `5–7 הבסיס, החישוב ושכר המינימום`

-- akn:art_5 The heading of §5.
-- akn:art_6 The heading of §6.
-- akn:art_7 The heading of §7.

-- 5.1: the salary base of the frame is the monthly average over the twelve
-- months April 2007–March 2008 of the combined salary, the seniority
-- supplement, every cost-of-living increment paid up to the salary of
-- March 2008, and the supplements in shekels and in percent ("התוספות"),
-- save (א) those not paid monthly, weekly or daily, (ב) those not updated
-- by the cost-of-living agreements, having a mechanism of their own, (ג)
-- the top-up to the minimum wage under the Minimum Wage Law, 1987. 5.2:
-- for the avoidance of doubt, (א) overtime (shifts, duty, standby,
-- call-outs and incentive pay) and (ב) the supplements, yearly supplements
-- and grants derived from the hour value's salary, the combined salary or
-- the budgetary pension's are in it. 5.3: expense reimbursements are not.
@ref akn:art_5__para_5-1 akn:art_5__para_5-1/p2 akn:art_5__para_5-1__subpara_a akn:art_5__para_5-1__subpara_b akn:art_5__para_5-1__subpara_c akn:art_5__para_5-2 akn:art_5__para_5-2__subpara_a akn:art_5__para_5-2__subpara_b akn:art_5__para_5-3
DECLARE `kind of 2008 framework pay component` IS ONE OF
    `the combined salary, the seniority supplement or a cost-of-living increment of the 2008 base`
    `overtime, shifts, duty, standby, call-outs or incentive pay of the 2008 base`
    `a supplement, yearly supplement or grant derived from the hour value's, the combined or the pension salary, of the 2008 base`
    `another supplement in shekels or in percent of the 2008 base`
    `an expense reimbursement of the 2008 base`

@desc A pay component, as section 5 of the framework agreement of 17.4.2008 tells them apart.
DECLARE `2008 framework pay component` HAS
    `the 2008 component's kind`                         IS A `kind of 2008 framework pay component`
    `the 2008 component is paid monthly, weekly or daily` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the 2008 component is updated by the cost-of-living agreements` IS A BOOLEAN @desc false where it has a mechanism of its own
    `the 2008 component is a minimum-wage top-up`       IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN c IS A `2008 framework pay component`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `one of §5.1's three exceptions` c IF
       NOT c's `the 2008 component is paid monthly, weekly or daily`
    OR NOT c's `the 2008 component is updated by the cost-of-living agreements`
    OR c's `the 2008 component is a minimum-wage top-up`

GIVEN c IS A `2008 framework pay component`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the base of the 2008 framework cost frame` c IF
    CONSIDER c's `the 2008 component's kind`
    WHEN `the combined salary, the seniority supplement or a cost-of-living increment of the 2008 base` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `overtime, shifts, duty, standby, call-outs or incentive pay of the 2008 base` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a supplement, yearly supplement or grant derived from the hour value's, the combined or the pension salary, of the 2008 base` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `another supplement in shekels or in percent of the 2008 base` THEN NOT `one of §5.1's three exceptions` c
    WHEN `an expense reimbursement of the 2008 base` THEN FALSE

-- The base is a monthly average of the twelve months April 2007–March 2008.
GIVEN `the twelve months from April 2007 to March 2008` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 framework salary base from` `the twelve months from April 2007 to March 2008` IS
    sum `the twelve months from April 2007 to March 2008` DIVIDED BY 12

`why the Minimum Wage Law is not in the 2008 framework` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוק שכר מינימום, התשמ\"ז-1987"

-- 5.4: a claim of the Histadrut that a supplement of 5.1(א)–(ג) belongs in
-- the base is discussed between the chair of the Histadrut and the wages
-- commissioner.
@ref akn:art_5__para_5-4
`a claim on §5.1's exceptions` MEANS
    PARTY `the wages commissioner`
    MUST  `discuss with the Histadrut a supplement it would put into the 2008 base`

-- akn:art_5__para_5-2__subpara_a/p2 A page number; no rule.

-- §6 ¶1: the computation of §5 is made for each Histadrut and national
-- union apart; ¶2: and for each employer apart — for this computation
-- alone, all the local authorities the Centre of Local Government
-- represents are one employer. The three large cities, which signed
-- apart, are not in that one.
@ref akn:art_6/p1 akn:art_6/p2
DECLARE `employer of the 2008 framework` IS ONE OF
    `the State, as an employer of the 2008 framework`
    `a local authority the Centre of Local Government represents`
    `another employer of the 2008 framework` HAS `its name in the 2008 framework` IS A STRING

GIVEN e IS AN `employer of the 2008 framework`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the employer §6 computes the 2008 cost for` e IS
    CONSIDER e
    WHEN `the State, as an employer of the 2008 framework` THEN "המדינה"
    WHEN `a local authority the Centre of Local Government represents` THEN "הרשויות המקומיות שמרכז השלטון המקומי מייצג"
    WHEN `another employer of the 2008 framework` n THEN n

`the 2008 cost is computed for each union apart` MEANS TRUE

-- §7 ¶1: the supplements agreed within the frame are not counted for the
-- top-up to the minimum wage; ¶2: but where an existing supplement that is
-- counted for it is raised, ¶1 does not apply to it — which takes nothing
-- from §4.
@ref akn:art_7/p1 akn:art_7/p2
GIVEN `raises an existing supplement counted for the minimum wage` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a 2008 framework supplement counts for the minimum-wage top-up` `raises an existing supplement counted for the minimum wage` IF
    `raises an existing supplement counted for the minimum wage`

§§ `8 מענק חד פעמי בגין תקופה על חשבון הסכם השכר`

-- akn:art_8 The heading of §8.

-- 8.1: following 4.1.1, an employee employed in 1.1.2008–30.11.2008, or
-- in part of it, has a one-time grant; 8.2: it is paid for that period.
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-1 akn:art_8__para_8-2
`the 2008 grant's period starts on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2008
`the 2008 grant's period ends on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 11 2008

-- 8.3: it is paid with the salary of May 2008, and by June 2008's at the
-- latest; at the same time a former employee, whose employment ended, is
-- paid his share of it.
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-3
`paying the 2008 grant` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the 2008 one-time grant`
    HENCE (PARTY `the employer`
           MUST  `pay a former employee his share of the 2008 grant`)

`the latest salary month the 2008 grant is paid with` MEANS `the 2008 framework month` 2008 6

-- ¶2: one who started work after the grant (and its contributions) was
-- paid is paid it with the salary of December 2008, or of the month after
-- the month his last salary was paid, whichever is earlier.
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-3/p2
GIVEN `the month his last salary was paid` IS A MAYBE NUMBER @desc as `the 2008 framework month`; NOTHING while he is still employed
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the salary month a later-joining employee is paid the 2008 grant with` `the month his last salary was paid` IS
    CONSIDER `the month his last salary was paid`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the 2008 framework month` 2008 12
    WHEN JUST l THEN min (`the 2008 framework month` 2008 12) (l PLUS 1)

`paying a later-joining employee the 2008 grant` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay a later-joining employee the 2008 grant`

-- 8.4 (how the grant is computed). 8.4.1, the first stage: the average of
-- each component of pay paid in the year 1.5.2007–30.4.2008 (the salaries
-- of May 2007 to April 2008) that is in the base of §5; ¶4: the total paid
-- for each component, each apart, divided by 12; ¶5: for one paid for part
-- of the year only, divided by the months he was paid for in it; ¶6–¶7:
-- one average for each component ("סכום הממוצע").
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-4 akn:art_8__para_8-4__subpara_8-4-1 akn:art_8__para_8-4__subpara_8-4-1/p2 akn:art_8__para_8-4__subpara_8-4-1/p4 akn:art_8__para_8-4__subpara_8-4-1/p5 akn:art_8__para_8-4__subpara_8-4-1/p6 akn:art_8__para_8-4__subpara_8-4-1/p7
GIVEN `paid for the component from May 2007 to April 2008` IS A NUMBER
      `the months he was paid for in that year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 grant's average of a component` `paid for the component from May 2007 to April 2008` `the months he was paid for in that year` IS
    IF `the months he was paid for in that year` AT LEAST 12
    THEN `paid for the component from May 2007 to April 2008` DIVIDED BY 12
    ELSE `paid for the component from May 2007 to April 2008` DIVIDED BY `the months he was paid for in that year`

-- akn:art_8__para_8-4__subpara_8-4-1/p3 A page number; no rule.

-- 8.4.2, the second stage: the grant is the sum of the averages times
-- 0.165 — eleven months of 4.1.1's 1.5%. ¶3: that is for one who actually
-- works the whole of 1.1–30.11.2008 (11 full months of work); one who
-- works part of it has the share of his actual work; ¶5: "actually works"
-- is the time worked and the time on paid annual or sick leave.
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-4__subpara_8-4-2 akn:art_8__para_8-4__subpara_8-4-2/p2 akn:art_8__para_8-4__subpara_8-4-2/p3 akn:art_8__para_8-4__subpara_8-4-2/p5
`the 2008 grant's multiplier` MEANS 0.165

GIVEN `months worked` IS A NUMBER, `months of paid annual leave` IS A NUMBER, `months of paid sick leave` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the months that count as actual work for the 2008 grant` `months worked` `months of paid annual leave` `months of paid sick leave` IS
    `months worked` PLUS `months of paid annual leave` PLUS `months of paid sick leave`

GIVEN `the averages of the components` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      `months of actual work in 1.1–30.11.2008` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 one-time grant` `the averages of the components` `months of actual work in 1.1–30.11.2008` IS
    sum `the averages of the components`
    TIMES `the 2008 grant's multiplier`
    TIMES min (`months of actual work in 1.1–30.11.2008` DIVIDED BY 11) 1

-- ¶3 (its last sentences): what was paid for a time he does not actually
-- work, its contributions among it, is an advance on account of anything
-- he is owed, a debt deducted from it. ¶4: so too for one who retired.
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-4__subpara_8-4-2/p4
GIVEN `the 2008 grant paid` IS A NUMBER, `the 2008 grant due` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the advance of the 2008 grant to deduct` `the 2008 grant paid` `the 2008 grant due` IS
    `not below zero` (`the 2008 grant paid` MINUS `the 2008 grant due`)

`the 2008 advance rule reaches one who retired` MEANS TRUE

-- 8.5: notwithstanding any agreement or arrangement, the grant is not pay
-- for any purpose and is not counted for severance pay or the hour value,
-- but contributions to a provident fund are made on it by 8.6. 8.7: it is
-- not counted for the top-up to the minimum wage.
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-5 akn:art_8__para_8-7
DECLARE `what the 2008 grant might count for` IS ONE OF
    `pay for any purpose, of the 2008 grant`
    `severance pay, of the 2008 grant`
    `the hour value, of the 2008 grant`
    `provident-fund contributions, of the 2008 grant`
    `the minimum-wage top-up, of the 2008 grant`

GIVEN p IS A `what the 2008 grant might count for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2008 grant counts for` p IF
    p EQUALS `provident-fund contributions, of the 2008 grant`

-- akn:art_8__para_8-7/p2 A page number; no rule.

-- 8.6: on each average times 0.165 a contribution is made to a provident
-- fund, as any agreement or arrangement requires (where it does) for the
-- component the average was taken of; 8.4.2's second paragraph (the share
-- for part of the period, the advance) applies to them too.
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-6 akn:art_8__para_8-6/p2
GIVEN `the component's average` IS A NUMBER
      `the contribution rate the component carries` IS A NUMBER @desc set by the agreement or arrangement that governs the component; 0 where none
      `months of actual work in 1.1–30.11.2008` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the provident-fund contribution on the 2008 grant for a component` `the component's average` `the contribution rate the component carries` `months of actual work in 1.1–30.11.2008` IS
    `the 2008 one-time grant` (LIST `the component's average`) `months of actual work in 1.1–30.11.2008`
    TIMES `the contribution rate the component carries`

`making the contributions on the 2008 grant` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `make the provident-fund contributions on the 2008 grant`

-- 8.8: the grant is computed and paid to a budgetary pensioner too, on the
-- components of his pension, for the time in 1.1–30.11.2008 he was
-- entitled to it, as for an active employee; ¶2: one entitled for part of
-- it has a share in proportion; ¶3: 8.6's contributions are not made for
-- him.
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-8 akn:art_8__para_8-8/p2 akn:art_8__para_8-8/p3
GIVEN `the averages of his pension's components` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      `months he was entitled to the pension in 1.1–30.11.2008` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 one-time grant of a budgetary pensioner` `the averages of his pension's components` `months he was entitled to the pension in 1.1–30.11.2008` IS
    `the 2008 one-time grant` `the averages of his pension's components` `months he was entitled to the pension in 1.1–30.11.2008`

`contributions are made on a pensioner's 2008 grant` MEANS FALSE

-- 8.9: paying the grant does not change the salary base of the salary
-- table in force on the eve of the signing.
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-9
`the 2008 grant changes the salary table` MEANS FALSE

§§ `9–10 משא ומתן נוסף ומועדי תשלום`

-- akn:art_9 The heading of §9.
-- akn:art_10 The heading of §10.

-- 9.1: soon after the signing the employers negotiate with each Histadrut
-- and union an agreement carrying out §§4–7, within the frame and §5's
-- base, save 4.1.1's frame, which §8 allocates (no deadline: convention
-- dates.no-deadline; 9.2 says what follows from 30.11.2008).
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-1
`negotiating the allocation of the 2008 frame` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `negotiate an agreement carrying out sections 4 to 7 of the 2008 framework`

-- What the agreements of §9 allocate: the frame from 1.12.2008.
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the frame a 2008 section 9 agreement allocates on` d IS
    `the 2008 framework frame allocated to monthly pay on` d

-- ¶2: each employer passes the Histadrut the salary data it holds that the
-- negotiation needs and the Histadrut asks for, subject to the law — the
-- Protection of Privacy Law, 1981, among it, with no identifying details;
-- ¶3: as the employer holds it, unprocessed. ¶4: a request that needs
-- processing the employer thinks reasonable is examined favourably; if the
-- employer agrees, it tells the Histadrut the estimated cost; the
-- Histadrut answers whether it bears it; if it does, the data are produced
-- and delivered against payment; if not, the request goes no further.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-1/p2 akn:art_9__para_9-1/p3
`passing the 2008 salary data` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pass the Histadrut the salary data it asks for under the 2008 framework`

@ref akn:art_9__para_9-1/p4
GIVEN `the processing is reasonable to the employer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `2008 framework action`
DECIDE `a 2008 request to process salary data` `the processing is reasonable to the employer` IS
    IF `the processing is reasonable to the employer`
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `examine a 2008 framework request to process salary data favourably`
         HENCE (PARTY `the employer`
                MUST  `tell the Histadrut the cost of processing the 2008 salary data`
                HENCE (PARTY `the New General Histadrut`
                       MUST  `say whether the Histadrut bears the cost of the 2008 processing`))
    ELSE FULFILLED

GIVEN `the Histadrut bears the cost` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `2008 framework action`
DECIDE `producing the processed 2008 data` `the Histadrut bears the cost` IS
    IF `the Histadrut bears the cost`
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `produce the processed 2008 salary data against payment`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- 9.2: where no agreement under 9.1 is signed for a scale by 30.11.2008,
-- the matter goes to the decision of the wages commissioner and the chair
-- of the Histadrut; ¶2: the other employers that signed agree that the
-- wages commissioner's decision under it binds them.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-2 akn:art_9__para_9-2/p2
`the last day for a 2008 section 9.1 agreement` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 11 2008

GIVEN `a 9.1 agreement for the scale was signed on` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the scale goes to the wages commissioner and the Histadrut's chair` `a 9.1 agreement for the scale was signed on` IF
    CONSIDER `a 9.1 agreement for the scale was signed on`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
    WHEN JUST s THEN NOT s `is on or before` `the last day for a 2008 section 9.1 agreement`

`deciding the scales left without a 2008 agreement` MEANS
    PARTY `the wages commissioner`
    MUST  `decide the scales left without a 2008 agreement`

`the wages commissioner's 2008 decision binds the other employers` MEANS TRUE

-- 9.3: where an agreement under 9.1 or 9.2 starts paying after the salary
-- of December 2008, the differences from 1.12.2008 to its first payment are
-- paid by 10.1.1–10.1.2, at the value the supplements have when paid.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-3
GIVEN `its first salary month` IS A NUMBER @desc as `the 2008 framework month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the months of differences from 1.12.2008` `its first salary month` IS
    `not below zero` (`its first salary month` MINUS `the 2008 framework month` 2008 12)

`paying the differences from 1.12.2008` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the differences from 1.12.2008`

-- 9.4: in no case does an agreement signed under the section pay anything
-- before 1.12.2008 or for the time before it.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-4
GIVEN `the payment's day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a 2008 section 9 agreement may pay on` `the payment's day` IF
    `the payment's day` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2008)

-- akn:art_9__para_9-4/p2 A page number; no rule.

-- 10.1: what the agreements of §9 give is paid, subject to them: 10.1.1
-- one signed by the 10th of a month, with that month's salary and by the
-- next month's at the latest; 10.1.2 one signed from the 11th, with the
-- next month's salary and by the one after it at the latest.
@ref akn:art_10__para_10-1 akn:art_10__para_10-1__subpara_10-1-1 akn:art_10__para_10-1__subpara_10-1-2
GIVEN `signed on day` IS A NUMBER, `of month` IS A NUMBER, `of year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the salary month a 2008 section 9 agreement is paid from` `signed on day` `of month` `of year` IS
    IF `signed on day` AT MOST 10
    THEN `the 2008 framework month` `of year` `of month`
    ELSE `the 2008 framework month` `of year` `of month` PLUS 1

GIVEN `signed on day` IS A NUMBER, `of month` IS A NUMBER, `of year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the latest salary month a 2008 section 9 agreement is paid from` `signed on day` `of month` `of year` IS
    `the salary month a 2008 section 9 agreement is paid from` `signed on day` `of month` `of year` PLUS 1

`paying a 2008 section 9 agreement` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay what a 2008 section 9 agreement gives`

§§ `11 גמלאים`

-- akn:art_11 The heading of §11.

-- 11.1: the Finance Minister states that he means to bring to the
-- government soon a bill amending the State Service (Pensions) Law, 1970
-- (outside the corpus), proposing what follows. The rules below are the
-- proposal's; 11.4 applies to the employers' pensioners what the amending
-- law will set.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-1
`bringing the 2008 pension bill` MEANS
    PARTY `the Treasury`
    MUST  `bring the bill linking the determining salary to the index to the government`

`why the Pensions Law is not in the 2008 framework` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוק שירות המדינה (גמלאות) [נוסח משולב], התש\"ל-1970, ותיקונו לפי סעיף 11"

-- (א): the determining salary, as at the employee's last month of work, is
-- updated once a year, from the first month of his pension, in the pension
-- for January, by the change in the consumer price index — in place of
-- the update by an active employee's salary. (ב): by the change from the
-- index for the December of the last update's year to that of the last
-- December before this one. (ג): a negative change in a year, or in
-- several, makes no update; but the changes of that time are counted in
-- full in the next update, or the ones after it. The salary therefore
-- rises, each January, only where the index passes the one it was last
-- raised by.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_a akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_b akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_c
GIVEN `the determining salary` IS A NUMBER
      `the index it was last set by` IS A NUMBER
      `each December's index since` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the determining salary after the yearly index updates` `the determining salary` `the index it was last set by` `each December's index since` IS
    CONSIDER `each December's index since`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN `the determining salary`
    WHEN i FOLLOWED BY rest THEN
        IF i GREATER THAN `the index it was last set by`
        THEN `the determining salary after the yearly index updates` (`the determining salary` TIMES i DIVIDED BY `the index it was last set by`) i rest
        ELSE `the determining salary after the yearly index updates` `the determining salary` `the index it was last set by` rest

-- (א) ¶2: no update in the pension for January 2009, because of supplement
-- B. (ב) ¶2: one who retires and starts his pension in a year has his
-- first update in the next year, by the change from his last month of
-- work's index to that December's; ¶3: not so for one first paid a pension
-- for December 2008 — the change from November to December 2008 is not
-- counted, because of supplement B. (ה): the mechanism reaches too (1) one
-- who retired before the amendment's commencement (by §17א of the Pensions
-- Law among them), and (2) survivors whose entitlement first formed before
-- it, the base index of the first update for both being December 2008's;
-- (3) survivors whose entitlement first forms from it. (ו): commencement on
-- 1.12.2008, the first update in the pension for January 2010 (or
-- February's, back to January), the change from November to December 2008
-- not counted.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_a/p2 akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_b/p2 akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_b/p3 akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_e akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_e__cls_1 akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_e__cls_2 akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_e__cls_3 akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_f
`the 2008 pension amendment commences on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2008
`the first yearly index update is in the pension for` MEANS `the 2008 framework month` 2010 1
`the January 2009 pension is updated by the index` MEANS FALSE

-- The index the first update starts from: December 2008's for one whose
-- pension (or survivors' entitlement) began before 1.12.2008 and for one
-- first paid for December 2008; else his last month of work's.
GIVEN `the first month of his pension` IS A NUMBER @desc as `the 2008 framework month`
      `the index of his last month of work` IS A NUMBER
      `the index of December 2008` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the base index of his first update` `the first month of his pension` `the index of his last month of work` `the index of December 2008` IS
    IF `the first month of his pension` AT MOST `the 2008 framework month` 2008 12
    THEN `the index of December 2008`
    ELSE `the index of his last month of work`

-- (ד): the update is made in the pension for January or for February; if
-- for February, January's update is paid with it.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_d
`updating the determining salary` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `update the determining salary in the January or February pension`

-- akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_e/p2 A page number; no rule.

-- (ז): a temporary provision paying supplements to every budgetary
-- pensioner in the civil service, in the scales it will list (all the
-- Histadrut's), who retired or will retire at the dates below, and to his
-- survivors.
-- (1) Supplement A, for the erosion of pensions in 1.1.2000–31.12.2007,
-- to one who retired by 31.12.07 (¶2–¶3): by the date he retired (column
-- A), a total of column B's rate on the base — his pension for the month,
-- with the supplement of the 2001 temporary provision ("תוספת 2001") —
-- (¶4) paid in steps, column C's cumulative rate from the pension for July
-- 2008, April 2009 and April 2010 (¶5). An empty cell of column C is no
-- further step: the rate reached stays.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g/p2 akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g/p3 akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g/p4 akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g/p5
@desc A row of supplement A's table.
DECLARE `supplement A row` HAS
    `retired by the end of the year`     IS A NUMBER @desc column A: "עד יום 31.12.2000", or the calendar year he retired in
    `supplement A's final rate`          IS A NUMBER @desc column B
    `supplement A's rate from July 2008`  IS A NUMBER
    `supplement A's rate from April 2009` IS A MAYBE NUMBER @desc NOTHING where the cell is empty
    `supplement A's rate from April 2010` IS A MAYBE NUMBER @desc NOTHING where the cell is empty

@ref akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g/t1
`supplement A's table` MEANS
    LIST `supplement A row` 2000 (12%) (5%) (JUST (9%)) (JUST (12%)),
         `supplement A row` 2001 (11%) (5%) (JUST (9%)) (JUST (11%)),
         `supplement A row` 2002 (10%) (5%) (JUST (9%)) (JUST (10%)),
         `supplement A row` 2003 (9%) (5%) (JUST (9%)) NOTHING,
         `supplement A row` 2004 (8%) (5%) (JUST (8%)) NOTHING,
         `supplement A row` 2005 (7%) (5%) (JUST (7%)) NOTHING,
         `supplement A row` 2006 (6%) (5%) (JUST (6%)) NOTHING,
         `supplement A row` 2007 (5%) (5%) NOTHING NOTHING

-- akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g/p7 A page number; no rule.
-- akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g/p8 A page number; no rule.

-- His row: the first year at or after the year he retired in ("עד יום
-- 31.12.2000" takes every year before 2001); none after 2007.
GIVEN `the year he retired in` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `supplement A row`
DECIDE `his row of supplement A's table` `the year he retired in` IS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `retired by the end of the year` AT LEAST `the year he retired in`) `supplement A's table`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
    WHEN r FOLLOWED BY more THEN JUST r

GIVEN `a step` IS A MAYBE NUMBER, `the rate so far` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `supplement A's rate after the step` `a step` `the rate so far` IS
    CONSIDER `a step`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the rate so far`
    WHEN JUST x THEN x

GIVEN `the year he retired in` IS A NUMBER, `the pension month` IS A NUMBER @desc as `the 2008 framework month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `supplement A's rate` `the year he retired in` `the pension month` IS
    CONSIDER `his row of supplement A's table` `the year he retired in`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0
    WHEN JUST r THEN
        BRANCH
            IF `the pension month` AT LEAST `the 2008 framework month` 2010 4
            THEN `supplement A's rate after the step` (r's `supplement A's rate from April 2010`)
                     (`supplement A's rate after the step` (r's `supplement A's rate from April 2009`) (r's `supplement A's rate from July 2008`))
            IF `the pension month` AT LEAST `the 2008 framework month` 2009 4
            THEN `supplement A's rate after the step` (r's `supplement A's rate from April 2009`) (r's `supplement A's rate from July 2008`)
            IF `the pension month` AT LEAST `the 2008 framework month` 2008 7
            THEN r's `supplement A's rate from July 2008`
            OTHERWISE 0

GIVEN `the year he retired in` IS A NUMBER, `the pension month` IS A NUMBER
      `his pension for the month` IS A NUMBER, `his תוספת 2001 for the month` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `supplement A` `the year he retired in` `the pension month` `his pension for the month` `his תוספת 2001 for the month` IS
    `supplement A's rate` `the year he retired in` `the pension month`
    TIMES (`his pension for the month` PLUS `his תוספת 2001 for the month`)

-- ¶6: supplement A's differences for the time up to the amendment's
-- commencement are paid with the pension for the month after the month it
-- commences in, or for the month after that.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g/p6
`paying supplement A's differences` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay supplement A's differences`

-- (2) Supplement B, for the rise in the cost of living in 2008, on his
-- pension, תוספת 2001 and supplement A for the month, to one who retired or
-- will retire by 31.12.08 (¶9–¶10): (א) for one who retired by 31.12.07,
-- the difference between (1) the change in the index from December 2007
-- to December 2008 and (2) column B of the table by the year he retired;
-- (ב) for one who retired in 1.1.2008–31.12.2008, the difference between
-- the index for his last month of work and December 2007's — read as
-- printed (convention reading.as-printed; finding F-framework-2008-b). A
-- difference never makes the supplement negative (convention
-- amounts.never-negative).
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g/p9 akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g/p10 akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g__cls_a akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g__cls_a/p2 akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g__cls_a__pnt_1 akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g__cls_a__pnt_2 akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g__cls_b
@desc A row of the table of supplement B (א)(2).
DECLARE `supplement B row` HAS
    `retired by the end of the year, for B` IS A NUMBER @desc "עד יום 31.12.2000", or the calendar year he retired in
    `the rate taken off the index`          IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g__cls_a__pnt_2/t1
`supplement B's table` MEANS
    LIST `supplement B row` 2000 (0.6%),
         `supplement B row` 2001 (0.55%),
         `supplement B row` 2002 (0.5%),
         `supplement B row` 2003 (0.45%),
         `supplement B row` 2004 (0.4%),
         `supplement B row` 2005 (0.35%),
         `supplement B row` 2006 (0.3%),
         `supplement B row` 2007 (0.25%)

GIVEN `the year he retired in` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the rate supplement B takes off the index` `the year he retired in` IS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `retired by the end of the year, for B` AT LEAST `the year he retired in`) `supplement B's table`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN 0
    WHEN r FOLLOWED BY more THEN r's `the rate taken off the index`

@desc What supplement B asks of a pensioner.
DECLARE `supplement B case` HAS
    `the year he retired in, for B`        IS A NUMBER
    `the index of December 2007, for B`           IS A NUMBER
    `the index of December 2008, for B`    IS A NUMBER
    `the index of his last month of work, for B` IS A NUMBER

GIVEN p IS A `supplement B case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `supplement B's rate` p IS
    IF p's `the year he retired in, for B` AT MOST 2007
    THEN `not below zero`
             (p's `the index of December 2008, for B` DIVIDED BY p's `the index of December 2007, for B` MINUS 1
              MINUS `the rate supplement B takes off the index` (p's `the year he retired in, for B`))
    ELSE IF p's `the year he retired in, for B` EQUALS 2008
         THEN `not below zero` (p's `the index of his last month of work, for B` DIVIDED BY p's `the index of December 2007, for B` MINUS 1)
         ELSE 0

GIVEN p IS A `supplement B case`, `his pension, תוספת 2001 and supplement A` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `supplement B` p `his pension, תוספת 2001 and supplement A` IS
    `supplement B's rate` p TIMES `his pension, תוספת 2001 and supplement A`

-- (ג): supplement B is paid from the pension for January 2009, or for
-- February 2009 with January's.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g__cls_c
`paying supplement B` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay supplement B from the January or February 2009 pension`

-- (3) Supplement C, on his pension, תוספת 2001, supplement A and
-- supplement B for the month, following the rise agreed for active
-- employees in this agreement (¶2–¶3); by the date he retired, column B's
-- cumulative rate in steps (¶5, the table): one who retired by 30.11.08
-- (inclusive), 3% from the pension for December 2008 and 5% from December
-- 2009's (¶6); one who retired in 1.12.08–30.11.09, 2% from December
-- 2009's (¶7).
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g__cls_c/p2 akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g__cls_c/p3 akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g__cls_c/p5 akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g__cls_c/p6 akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g__cls_c/p7 akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g__cls_c/t1
GIVEN `he retired on` IS A DATE, `the pension month` IS A NUMBER @desc as `the 2008 framework month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `supplement C's rate` `he retired on` `the pension month` IS
    IF `he retired on` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 11 2008)
    THEN BRANCH
             IF `the pension month` AT LEAST `the 2008 framework month` 2009 12 THEN 5%
             IF `the pension month` AT LEAST `the 2008 framework month` 2008 12 THEN 3%
             OTHERWISE 0
    ELSE IF `he retired on` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 11 2009)
            AND `the pension month` AT LEAST `the 2008 framework month` 2009 12
         THEN 2%
         ELSE 0

-- akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_g__cls_c/p4 A page number; no rule.

-- (ח): (ז) reaches too one who took his pension under §17א of the Pensions
-- Law and meets its conditions, from when he is entitled to it, but not
-- before (ז)'s dates.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-1__subpara_h
GIVEN `the month his §17א pension starts` IS A NUMBER, `the month (ז) pays the supplement from` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the month a §17א pensioner's supplement starts` `the month his §17א pension starts` `the month (ז) pays the supplement from` IS
    max `the month his §17א pension starts` `the month (ז) pays the supplement from`

-- 11.2: the Histadrut states that (א) it accepts the bill of 11.1 and will
-- support its passage as one package; (ב) once it is passed, it has no
-- demand of any supplement to the pensions for their erosion in the time
-- to 31.12.2008; (ג) it knows the first amendment (the update of the
-- determining salary) applies of itself from its commencement to every
-- employee and pensioner in a budgetary pension of the employers that are
-- parties and that apply the Pensions Law's arrangement, and it will have
-- no claim on that.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-2 akn:art_11__para_11-2__subpara_a akn:art_11__para_11-2__subpara_b akn:art_11__para_11-2__subpara_c
`supporting the 2008 pension bill` MEANS
    PARTY `the New General Histadrut`
    MUST  `support the 2008 pension bill as one package`

`no further demand for erosion to 31.12.2008` MEANS
    PARTY `the New General Histadrut`
    SHANT `demand a further pension rise for erosion to 31.12.2008`

`no claim against the automatic change` MEANS
    PARTY `the New General Histadrut`
    SHANT `claim against the automatic change of the pension update`

-- 11.3: with no further condition, for an employer that is a party whose
-- budgetary pension is set by an agreement or arrangement updating the
-- determining salary by an active employee's: from the first amendment's
-- commencement that mechanism is replaced by (¶4) "the update of the
-- determining salary follows the mechanism of the Pensions Law".
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-3 akn:art_11__para_11-3/p2 akn:art_11__para_11-3/p4
DECLARE `how a determining salary is updated` IS ONE OF
    `by an active employee's salary`
    `by the mechanism of the Pensions Law`

GIVEN `the arrangement updated it by an active employee's salary` IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A `how a determining salary is updated`
DECIDE `how an employer's arrangement updates the determining salary on` `the arrangement updated it by an active employee's salary` d IS
    IF `the arrangement updated it by an active employee's salary`
       AND NOT d `is on or after` `the 2008 pension amendment commences on`
    THEN `by an active employee's salary`
    ELSE `by the mechanism of the Pensions Law`

-- akn:art_11__para_11-3/p3 A page number; no rule.

-- 11.4: once the amendment is passed and the mechanism changed at the
-- employers (11.2(ג), 11.3), the supplements to the pensions that its
-- temporary provision sets (as 11.1(ז)) are applied to their budgetary
-- pensioners, at the dates and rates the amendment sets. (The corpus prints
-- "(ז)" of "11.1(ז)" as a paragraph of its own.)
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-4 akn:art_11__para_11-4__subpara_g
`applying the amending law's supplements` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `apply the pension supplements the amending law sets`

`where the supplements' operative rates are set` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "תיקון חוק שירות המדינה (גמלאות) לפי סעיף 11.1 להסכם המסגרת מיום 17.4.2008 (הוראת שעה)"

-- 11.5: from the commencement, a budgetary pensioner's determining salary
-- follows no change in an active employee's pay, nor in the public
-- service's pay, cost-of-living increments among them. 11.6: the proposal
-- changes none of the components counted in the determining salary, of
-- one about to retire or of one who has.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-5 akn:art_11__para_11-6
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a determining salary follows active pay on` d IF
    NOT d `is on or after` `the 2008 pension amendment commences on`

`the 2008 bill changes the components of the determining salary` MEANS FALSE

-- 11.7: if the amendments are not passed by 31.12.08 the parties discuss
-- the pensioners (and, mutatis mutandis, the section's dates).
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-7
GIVEN `the amendments were passed on` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `2008 framework action`
DECIDE `discussing the pensioners` `the amendments were passed on` IS
    CONSIDER `the amendments were passed on`
    WHEN JUST p THEN
        IF p `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2008)
        THEN FULFILLED
        ELSE PARTY `the State`
             MUST  `discuss the pensioners if the bill is not passed by 31.12.2008`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN
        PARTY `the State`
        MUST  `discuss the pensioners if the bill is not passed by 31.12.2008`

-- 11.8: the section does not reach accrual-pension members who took early
-- retirement and are paid by the employer until the accrual pension's age.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-8
GIVEN `an accrual-pension early retiree paid by the employer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 11 of the 2008 framework reaches the pensioner` `an accrual-pension early retiree paid by the employer` IF
    NOT `an accrual-pension early retiree paid by the employer`

§§ `12 רווחה לגמלאים בפנסיה תקציבית`

-- akn:art_12 The heading of §12.

-- 12.1: from the fiscal year 2008, each employer paying budgetary pensions
-- (in the Histadrut's scales) sets aside, once a year, for those
-- pensioners' welfare, 393 for each pensioner (of old age or disability) in
-- the budgetary pension; ¶3: for one entitled for part of the year, in
-- proportion to it; ¶4: none for accrual-pension early retirees paid by
-- the employer.
@ref akn:art_12__para_12-1 akn:art_12__para_12-1/p2 akn:art_12__para_12-1/p3 akn:art_12__para_12-1/p4
`the welfare sum for each pensioner in 2008` MEANS 393

GIVEN `the sum for each pensioner` IS A NUMBER
      `each pensioner's share of the year` IS A LIST OF NUMBER @desc 1 for a whole year; accrual-pension early retirees left out
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the pensioners' welfare sum` `the sum for each pensioner` `each pensioner's share of the year` IS
    `the sum for each pensioner` TIMES sum (map (GIVEN s YIELD min s 1) `each pensioner's share of the year`)

-- 12.2: the Histadrut sets up an internal fund it manages for the welfare
-- (culture, health, holidays and leisure, for instance) of the budgetary
-- pensioners in its scales ("קרן רווחה").
@ref akn:art_12__para_12-2
`setting up the welfare fund` MEANS
    PARTY `the New General Histadrut`
    MUST  `set up the pensioners' welfare fund`

-- akn:art_12__para_12-2/p2 A page number; no rule.

-- 12.3: the sum, less any tax or other compulsory payment the law levies
-- on it from time to time, is transferred to the fund in January each
-- year. 12.4: the first payment, for 2008, by the end of the month after the
-- month the first amendment is passed — "as said in section 10 above"; the
-- amendment is §11's (finding F-framework-2008-a). 12.7: the employers'
-- duty under the section holds only once the first amendment is passed.
@ref akn:art_12__para_12-3 akn:art_12__para_12-4 akn:art_12__para_12-7
GIVEN `the sum` IS A NUMBER, `tax and compulsory payments on it` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `what is transferred to the welfare fund` `the sum` `tax and compulsory payments on it` IS
    `not below zero` (`the sum` MINUS `tax and compulsory payments on it`)

GIVEN `the month the first amendment was passed` IS A MAYBE NUMBER @desc as `the 2008 framework month`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `2008 framework action`
DECIDE `transferring the welfare sum` `the month the first amendment was passed` IS
    CONSIDER `the month the first amendment was passed`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FULFILLED
    WHEN JUST m THEN
        PARTY `the employer`
        MUST  `transfer the pensioners' welfare sum to the fund`

GIVEN `the month the first amendment was passed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the last month for the first welfare payment` `the month the first amendment was passed` IS
    `the month the first amendment was passed` PLUS 1

-- 12.5: from the fiscal year 2009, each year, the 393 is updated by the
-- change from the index of the December before the year before (published
-- 15 January) to that of the last December; ¶2: for the first payment, in
-- January 2009, by the change from December 2007 to December 2008.
@ref akn:art_12__para_12-5 akn:art_12__para_12-5/p2
GIVEN `the sum before the update` IS A NUMBER, `the earlier December's index` IS A NUMBER, `the last December's index` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the welfare sum updated` `the sum before the update` `the earlier December's index` `the last December's index` IS
    `the sum before the update` TIMES `the last December's index` DIVIDED BY `the earlier December's index`

-- 12.6: the Histadrut sends the Accountant General and the other employers
-- (the body each names) the welfare fund's financial reports once a year;
-- ¶2: with the fund's actions and spending in the year before, and an
-- accountant's confirmation that the money went only to 12.2's purposes;
-- ¶3: a copy to the wages commissioner. ¶4: where it emerges the money was
-- used for other purposes, each employer may hold back further transfers
-- until it is settled.
@ref akn:art_12__para_12-6 akn:art_12__para_12-6/p2 akn:art_12__para_12-6/p3 akn:art_12__para_12-6/p4
`reporting on the welfare fund` MEANS
    PARTY `the New General Histadrut`
    MUST  `report on the welfare fund each year`
    HENCE (PARTY `the New General Histadrut`
           MUST  `send the wages commissioner a copy of the 2008 welfare fund's reports`)

GIVEN `the fund's money went to other purposes` IS A BOOLEAN, `the matter was settled` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an employer may hold back the welfare transfers` `the fund's money went to other purposes` `the matter was settled` IF
    `the fund's money went to other purposes` AND NOT `the matter was settled`

§§ `13 מבנה העסקה`

-- akn:art_13 The heading of §13.

-- 13.1: a supreme parity committee is set up to recommend principles for
-- changing the structure of employment in the public service; ¶2: the
-- parties name their members within 30 days of the signing; ¶3: it may
-- sit in smaller panels as it decides.
@ref akn:art_13__para_13-1 akn:art_13__para_13-1/p2 akn:art_13__para_13-1/p3
`naming the supreme parity committee` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `name the members of the supreme parity committee`
    WITHIN 30

-- 13.2: at each employer that signed, within 60 days of the signing, a
-- parity committee seeks agreed ways to apply the employer's collective
-- agreements (¶2) to new kinds of employees, the unorganised among them,
-- with regard to the relevant agreements; ¶3: with it, a wider managerial
-- flexibility is examined; ¶4: setting it up changes nothing in how
-- employees are taken on, unless expressly agreed in writing; ¶5: subject
-- to the law — the State Service (Appointments) Law, 1959 and its
-- regulations among it — to government decisions and to the collective
-- agreements in force. 13.3: by consent it may discuss existing employees
-- outside the agreements, and those inside them. 13.4: with no agreed
-- solution 90 days after a matter is brought to it, each party may act by
-- the means it has, its claims kept. 13.5: the section does not reach
-- Clalit.
@ref akn:art_13__para_13-2 akn:art_13__para_13-2/p2 akn:art_13__para_13-2/p3 akn:art_13__para_13-2/p4 akn:art_13__para_13-2/p5 akn:art_13__para_13-3 akn:art_13__para_13-4 akn:art_13__para_13-5
GIVEN `the employer is Clalit` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `2008 framework action`
DECIDE `setting up the employer's parity committee` `the employer is Clalit` IS
    IF `the employer is Clalit`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `set up an employer's parity committee on the structure of employment`
         WITHIN 60

`the committee changes how employees are taken on, unless agreed in writing` MEANS FALSE

GIVEN `days since the matter was brought` IS A NUMBER, `an agreed solution was found` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the parties may act by their own means on the structure of employment` `days since the matter was brought` `an agreed solution was found` IF
    (NOT `an agreed solution was found`) AND `days since the matter was brought` AT LEAST 90

§§ `14 דרגת פרישה בשירות המדינה`

-- akn:art_14 The heading of §14.

-- 14.1: the Finance Minister states he means to propose to the government
-- cancelling §3 of its decision 781 of 15.09.2003 (no retirement grade in
-- the civil service).
@ref akn:art_14__para_14-1
`proposing to cancel section 3 of decision 781` MEANS
    PARTY `the Treasury`
    MUST  `bring the proposal to cancel section 3 of decision 781 to the government`

-- 14.2: the rules of entitlement to a retirement grade for those entitled
-- to a pension under the Pensions Law, in paragraph 85.125 of the Takshir
-- as worded on the day of signing, have from that day the standing of a
-- collective agreement, for civil-service employees whose pay is set by
-- the agreements of the Histadrut's scales and whom the rules concern; ¶2:
-- the paragraph is annexed (encoded below); ¶3: this changes neither the
-- rules nor their conditions.
@ref akn:art_14__para_14-2 akn:art_14__para_14-2/p2 akn:art_14__para_14-2/p3
GIVEN e IS A `2008 framework employee`, `in the civil service` IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `paragraph 85.125 binds as a collective agreement for` e `in the civil service` d IF
        `in the civil service`
    AND e's `his pay is computed by the agreements of a scale the Histadrut represents`
    AND d `is on or after` `the 2008 framework agreement was signed on`

`making paragraph 85.125 an agreement changes its rules` MEANS FALSE

§§ `15–20 סכסוכים, מיצוי, שקט, הסכמים קודמים, ועדת מעקב ובוררות`

-- akn:art_15 The heading of §15.
-- akn:art_16 The heading of §16.
-- akn:art_17 The heading of §17.
-- akn:art_18 The heading of §18.
-- akn:art_19 The heading of §19.
-- akn:art_20 The heading of §20.

-- §15: the collective disputes, national and local, declared on what it
-- settles are void on signing — that of 19.6.2007 among them.
@ref akn:art_15/p1 akn:art_15/p2
`the disputes on the 2008 framework's matters stand` MEANS FALSE

-- akn:art_15/p3 A page number; no rule.

-- 16.1: the agreement exhausts all the parties' claims, national and
-- local, on enlarging the cost frame, for the time to 31.12.2008 — §6 of
-- the agreement of 31.01.2001 and the disagreement on §9 of the agreement
-- of 22.05.2003 ("the wage-reduction agreement") among them. 16.2: that,
-- and industrial peace, do not reach (א) claims pending before the agreed
-- arbitration institution, or in the courts; (ב) pending economic disputes
-- declared lawfully before the signing; (ג) the Clalit employees'
-- organisation's demand on the functioning chart of Clalit's
-- administration and maintenance staff.
@ref akn:art_16__para_16-1 akn:art_16__para_16-2 akn:art_16__para_16-2__subpara_a akn:art_16__para_16-2__subpara_b akn:art_16__para_16-2__subpara_c
GIVEN `pending in arbitration or a court` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a pending economic dispute declared before the signing` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Clalit functioning-chart demand` IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2008 framework exhausts the claim` `pending in arbitration or a court` `a pending economic dispute declared before the signing` `the Clalit functioning-chart demand` d IF
        d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2008)
    AND NOT `pending in arbitration or a court`
    AND NOT `a pending economic dispute declared before the signing`
    AND NOT `the Clalit functioning-chart demand`

-- ¶ (after 16.2(ג)): subject to that "and to §8", no further negotiation on
-- wages or wage benefits, at any level, for the agreement's period, for the
-- employees it covers. The negotiation the agreement keeps open is §9's;
-- §8 is the grant (finding F-framework-2008-a).
@ref akn:art_16__para_16-2__subpara_c/p2
`no further wage negotiation in the 2008 framework's period` MEANS
    PARTY `the New General Histadrut`
    SHANT `negotiate further on pay for the 2008 framework's period`

-- §17: in the agreement's period the Histadrut does not strike, in full or
-- in part, against any employer, nor harm the work in an organised way,
-- over what it settles, nationally or locally; ¶2: §13's matters are not
-- matters it settles.
@ref akn:art_17/p1 akn:art_17/p2
`industrial peace under the 2008 framework` MEANS
    PARTY `the New General Histadrut`
    SHANT `strike over a matter the 2008 framework settled`

`the structure of employment is a matter the 2008 framework settled` MEANS FALSE

-- §18: earlier terms stand for its period unless it amends or cancels
-- them, expressly or by implication.
@ref akn:art_18/p1
`earlier terms stand unless the 2008 framework changes them` MEANS TRUE

-- §19: a follow-up committee of the wages commissioner and the chair of
-- the Histadrut goes on following and helping to carry out the agreement,
-- and decides the disagreements on it; ¶2: its decisions are final and
-- bind the parties.
@ref akn:art_19/p1 akn:art_19/p2
`deciding disputes over the 2008 framework` MEANS
    PARTY `the follow-up committee`
    MUST  `decide disputes over the 2008 framework`

`the 2008 follow-up committee's decisions are final` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:art_19/p3 A page number; no rule.

-- §20: the agreement on the agreed arbitration institution in the public
-- services is extended, as it stands, until the next national wage
-- agreement is signed.
@ref akn:art_20/p1
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `the next national wage agreement was signed on` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the arbitration institution agreement stands under the 2008 framework on` d `the next national wage agreement was signed on` IS
    CONSIDER `the next national wage agreement was signed on`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
    WHEN JUST s THEN NOT d `is on or after` s

